?oc=5","date":"2026-10-15","zh":"好時（NYSE：HSY）股票預測與分析師預測"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/47111/000162828026008586/hsy-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Hershey Company was incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware on October 24, 1927 as a successor to a business founded in 1894 by Milton S. Hershey. In this report, the terms \"Hershey,\" \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" or \"our\" mean The Hershey Company and its wholly-owned subsidiaries and entities in which it has a controlling financial interest, unless the context indicates otherwise.","zh":"好時公司於 1927 年 10 月 24 日根據特拉華州法律成立，繼承了米爾頓·S·好時 (Milton S. Hershey) 於 1894 年創立的企業。在本報告中，除非上下文另有說明，否則術語「好時」、「本公司」、「我們」或「我們的」是指好時公司及其全資子公司和擁有控股財務權益的實體。"},{"en":"Hershey is a global confectionery leader known for making more moments of goodness through chocolate, sweets, mints, and other great tasting snacks. We are the largest producer of quality chocolate in North America, a leading snack maker in the United States and a global leader in chocolate and non-chocolate confectionery. We market, sell, and distribute our products under more than 85 brand names in approximately 65 countries worldwide.","zh":"好時是全球糖果業的領導者，以透過巧克力、糖果、薄荷糖和其他美味零食創造更多美好時刻而聞名。我們是北美最大的優質巧克力生產商、美國領先的零食製造商以及巧克力和非巧克力糖果的全球領導者。我們在全球約 65 個國家以超過 85 個品牌行銷、銷售和分銷我們的產品。"},{"en":"The Company reports its operations through three segments: (i) North America Confectionery, (ii) North America Salty Snacks and (iii) International. This organizational structure aligns with how our Chief Operating Decision Maker (\"CODM\") manages our business, including resource allocation and performance assessment, and further aligns with our product categories and the key markets we serve.","zh":"該公司透過三個部門報告其運作：(i) 北美糖果部門、(ii) 北美鹹味零食部門和 (iii) 國際部門。這種組織結構與我們的首席營運決策者（「CODM」）管理我們業務的方式（包括資源分配和績效評估）保持一致，並進一步與我們的產品類別和我們服務的主要市場保持一致。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our principal product offerings include chocolate and non-chocolate confectionery products; gum and mint refreshment products and protein bars; snack items such as popcorn, pretzels, spreads, snack bites and mixes; and pantry items, such as baking ingredients, toppings, and beverages.","zh":"我們的主要產品包括巧克力和非巧克力糖果產品；口香糖和薄荷茶點產品以及蛋白質棒；零食，例如爆米花、椒鹽捲餅、塗抹醬、小吃和混合食品；以及食品儲藏室物品，例如烘焙原料、配料和飲料。"},{"en":"Within our North America Confectionery segment, our product portfolio includes a wide variety of chocolate offerings marketed and sold under the renowned brands of Hershey's, Reese's and Kisses, along with other popular chocolate and non-chocolate confectionery brands such as Jolly Rancher, Almond Joy, Brookside, barkTHINS, Cadbury, Good & Plenty, Heath, Kit Kat , Payday, Rolo , Twizzlers, Sour Strips, Whoppers and York. Our protein bar products include ONE bar and our gum and mint products include Ice Breakers mints and chewing gum, Breath Savers mints and Bubble Yum bubble gum. We also have pantry items, including baking products, toppings and sundae syrups sold under the Hershey's, Reese's, Heath and Lily's brands, as well as Hershey's and Reese's chocolate spreads and snack bites and mixes.","zh":"在我們的北美糖果部門，我們的產品組合包括以 Hershey's、Reese's 和 Kisses 等知名品牌行銷和銷售的各種巧克力產品，以及其他受歡迎的巧克力和非巧克力糖果品牌，如 Jolly Rancher、Almond Joy、Brookside、barkTHINS、Cadbury、Good & Plenty、Heath、Kripr Kat、Payday、Rolo、Sakt、Wht、Kript、Kript、Kript、Wht、Surt、Smant、Stag、Kidwler、Kript、Surt、Sadillas、Stus、Kswlers、Whtour、Kriplers、WhtsS。我們的蛋白棒產品包括 ONE 棒，我們的口香糖和薄荷產品包括 Ice Breakers 薄荷糖和口香糖、Breath Savers 薄荷糖和 Bubble Yum 泡泡糖。我們還提供食品儲藏室產品，包括以 Hershey's、Reese's、Heath 和 Lily's 品牌銷售的烘焙產品、配料和聖代糖漿，以及 Hershey's 和 Reese's 巧克力醬以及零食和混合物。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Many of our confectionery and salty snack brands enjoy wide consumer acceptance and are among the leading brands sold in the marketplace in North America and certain international markets. We sell our brands in highly competitive markets with many other global multinational, national, regional and local firms. Some of our competitors are large private companies, as well as large retailers, that have significant resources and substantial international operations. Competition in our product categories is based on product innovation, product quality, price, brand recognition and loyalty, effectiveness of marketing and promotional activity, the ability to identify and satisfy consumer preferences, as well as convenience and service. We have also experienced increased competition from other snack items, and through innovation and acquisitions, we are continuing to expand the boundaries of our","zh":"我們的許多醣果和鹹味零食品牌都受到消費者的廣泛認可，並且是北美和某些國際市場上銷售的領先品牌之一。我們在競爭激烈的市場上與許多其他全球跨國、國家、地區和本地公司一起銷售我們的品牌。我們的一些競爭對手是大型私人公司以及大型零售商，他們擁有豐富的資源和大量的國際業務。我們產品類別的競爭是基於產品創新、產品品質、價格、品牌認知度和忠誠度、行銷和促銷活動的有效性、識別和滿足消費者偏好的能力以及便利性和服務。我們也經歷了來自其他零食的日益激烈的競爭，透過創新和收購，我們正在繼續擴大我們的業務範圍"},{"en":"Our sales are typically higher during the third and fourth quarters of the year, representing seasonal and holiday-related sales patterns. We manufacture primarily for stock and typically fill customer orders within a few days of receipt. Therefore, the backlog of any unfilled orders is not material to our total annual sales. Additional information relating to our cash flows from operations and working capital practices is provided in our Management's Discussion and Analysis.","zh":"我們的銷售額通常在一年中的第三和第四季較高，代表季節性和假日相關的銷售模式。我們主要生產庫存，通常在收到客戶訂單後幾天內完成訂單。因此，任何未完成訂單的積壓對我們的年度總銷售額並不重要。有關我們的營運現金流和營運資本實踐的更多資訊，請參閱我們的管理層討論和分析。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America Confectionery","val":9479709000,"zh":"北美糖果市場"},{"name":"North America Salty Snacks","val":1271299000,"zh":"北美鹹味零食市場"},{"name":"International","val":941568000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":11692576000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":10251643000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":1440933000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":11692576000}},"peers":["GIS","CPB","CL","MKC","CLX"]}}